    subtopic: 'The Hausa And Nupe',
    summary_60s: 'The Hausa States The Hausa States were a group of city-states in what is now northern Nigeria. These include: Zaria Kano Katsina Biram Gobir Daura Rano These are often referred to as the “legitimate sons” of Bayajidda , a legendary figure in Hausa history. Factors That Influenced',
